title: "How Few Sensors Are Enough? Reproducibility Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility pipeline for the systematic evaluation of minimum vital sign
  requirements for machine-learning-based clinical deterioration prediction,
  with multi-center validation across 139 hospitals using MIMIC-IV and eICU-CRD.
